message: >-
  If you use this code or the benchmark results in your work, please cite it
  as below.
title: "resources-tools: companion code and benchmark results for Bit to Byte Academy"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for articles on bittobyteacademy.com. It includes the
  edge-ai-toolkit, which covers data contracts between Python training code
  and C firmware, a benchmark of ten storage options for sensor data, and a
  comparison of pandas and DuckDB, with results measured on a Raspberry Pi 5,
  and examples for running services with systemd on embedded Linux.
type: software
authors:
